==Finnish==

===Suffix===
'''-ton'''/'''-tön'''

# (''denominal'') Indicates lack of something (similar to [[-less]]) or [[in-]], [[im-]],[[il-]] and [[ir-]].
:*Examples:
::*[[aika]] ''time'' → [[ajaton]] ''timeless''
::*[[järki]] ''sense'' → [[järjetön]] ''senseless''
::*[[maku]] ''taste'' → [[mauton]] ''tasteless''
::*[[näkymätön]] ''invisible'' (agent participle of [[näkyä]] ''to be visible'' + ''-tön'')
::*[[kuolematon]] ''immortal'' (agent participle of [[kuolla]] ''to die'' + ''-ton'')
::*[[ääri]] ''border'' → [[ääretön]] ''infinite''

====Antonyms====
*[[-llinen]]

====Declension====
Inflected like [[Wiktionary:Finnish inflection types/nouns/onneton|onneton]] (back vowel harmony) or [[Wiktionary:Finnish inflection types/nouns/nimetön|nimetön]] (front vowel harmony).

